    "conclusionRelativeToTarget": "same-person",
    "confidence": "high",
    "rationale": "Target full identity: Yu/Xizu, Hui’s eldest son and Xie’s son, Minhuai, Guangling prince→crown prince, murdered by Sun Lü’s pestle at Xuchang, three sons. Narrator, forged prayer and retrospective letter frames stay distinguished.",
    "primarySourceAnchors": [
