  {
    "localPersonId": "zizhitongjian:083:p028",
    "canonicalPersonId": "per_WW9A5AHDEH5VZ73G7FE0",
    "conclusionRelativeToTarget": "same-person",
    "confidence": "high",
    "rationale": "Actual 遹 in death edict and Yan Zuan’s defense, alongside crown-prince deposition and three sons, identifies Yu. Reject the foreign English Yu within Du Yu at0150 and He Yu at0194 as identity evidence; the clear Chinese core remains target Minhuai.",
    "primarySourceAnchors": [
      {
        "unitId": "zizhitongjian:083:s0185",
        "zh": "壬戌，帝幸式乾殿，召公卿入，使黃門令董猛以太子書及青紙詔示之曰：「遹書如此，今賜死。」"
      },
      {
        "unitId": "zizhitongjian:083:s0194",
        "zh": "於是使尚書和郁等持節詣東宮，廢太子為庶人，太子改服出，再拜受詔，步出承華門，乘粗犢車，車武公澹以兵仗送太子及妃王氏、三子虨、臧、尚同幽於金墉城。"
      },
      {
        "unitId": "zizhitongjian:083:s0201",
        "zh": "今遹受罪之日，不敢失道，猶為輕於戾太子。"
      }
    ],
